starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Can be replaced by the following:\r\n```\r\nRect2i new_render_region = (render_region != Rect2i()) ? render_region : Rect2i(Point2i(0, 0), render_state.main_swapchain_size);\r\n```\r\n\r\nIn addition:\r\n- The [`Rect2i` documentation](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_rect2i.html) states that `Rect2i() == false`, so we can replace `render_region != Rect2i()` with `render_region != false`\r\n- `Point2i(0, 0)` can be replaced by `Vector2i.ZERO`\r\n- Do we expect `Rect2i(Point2i(0, 0), render_state.main_swapchain_size)` to change every frame?","created_at":"2024-11-19T14:41:23Z","updated_at":"2024-11-19T14:48:20Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99407#discussion_r1848491585","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99407","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1848491585"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99407#discussion_r1848491585"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99407"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1848491585/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":2385,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":null,"original_line":2388,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":20,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1848949121","pull_request_review_id":2446477653,"id":1848949121,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc5uNLmB","diff_hunk":"@@ -2376,6 +2382,26 @@ void OpenXRAPI::end_frame() {\n \t\t}\n \t}\n \n+\tRect2i new_render_region = Rect2i(Point2i(0, 0), render_state.main_swapchain_size);\n+\tif (render_region != Rect2i()) {\n+\t\tnew_render_region = render_region;\n+\t}","path":"modules/openxr/openxr_api.cpp","commit_id":"e7f6b7ea0b9ff83e1b152f127d68fd905f503b4b","original_commit_id":"ae0a7a4fd6db3e7c771be237188923420ba32e77","user":{"login":"devloglogan","id":95497005,"node_id":"U_kgDOBbErLQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95497005?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan","html_url":"https://github.com/devloglogan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I've made the suggested replacement, thanks! As to your other points, the `Rect2i() == false` and `Vector2i.ZERO` suggestions I believe would only work in editor?\r\n\r\n`Rect2i(Point2i(0, 0), render_state.main_swapchain_size)` would typically remain the same, it would only be resized if a new swapchain was created (with a different size). Maybe on swapchain creation I could just store the size in a variable rather than creating this every frame.","created_at":"2024-11-19T19